    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c9c2524d-d879-4a68-99c5-346c012b0b08\n\n1. `<C-v>` shouldn't select anything by default—which is fine—but it triggers visual highlighting.\n2. `<C-v>j` shouldn't select anything, yet it does.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n. \n\n### Expected behavior\n\n.\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\nNVIM v0.13.0-dev-1806+g7c53167b5d\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nSame issue\n\n### Operating system/version\n\narch\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nkitty\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nxterm-kitty\n\n### Installation\n\nbuild",
    "closed_at": null,
    "closed_by": null,
