            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I feel that with `selection=exclusive`, the cursor should not be treated as a `block` (`cell`), but rather as a `boundary`.\n\nThis establishes the visual start boundary, while the subsequent `motion` determines the end boundary.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-05T12:49:07Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/42243#issuecomment-5994773510",
